Note on the sample data

The MIT grant above covers the source code, documentation and tools in this
repository.

The BAML and XAML files under `samples/` are extracted, unmodified, from
Microsoft Windows Longhorn pre-release builds. They remain the property of
Microsoft Corporation and are NOT covered by the MIT grant. They are included
solely as format-discrimination fixtures and test data for an independent
interoperability tool targeting abandoned pre-release software.

This project is not affiliated with, authorised by, or endorsed by Microsoft.
